{"seq":16,"trial_id":"v02-heldout-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-gbrain-told-mu-v02-heldout/ms-07-strategic-owners/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T02:29:05.476Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"d2f0646456d94d123e63a2460d48f98663177d2460fb243deab1f4955f2926d1","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"Ruth, here's what Moss's Strategic digests (teams/team-strategic/digests) support:\n\n• Vantorre Group: Gideon Sato. It moved from Nadia Fennimore to Gideon on 2026-05-04. Moss's 5/3 Sunday prep says \"changes hands tomorrow, 2026-05-04\", and the 5/4 digest confirms the CRM reassignment that day.\n• Vantorre Mobility: Gideon Sato. The 5/4 digest says he \"assumed management\" of it that day, though earlier digests already call it \"Gideon's fleet account\".\n• Orlavine Medical Supply: Gideon Sato, but this is inferred. The 9/30 digest only says \"Gideon's medical account\", and Orlavine is the only medical account in it. The Mar 2025 digest called it Nadia's medical account. No digest records when it moved, so I can't give you a date.\n• Quillfeather Outfitters: Not confirmed. The digests only call it the pod's \"retail/outdoor account\" and never name an owner. The only pointer is Nadia hosting the 10/2 gate-clerk training and relaying a QFO request in #strategic-random. I'd check the CRM with Nadia or Gideon before it goes on the slide.\n\nThe digests stop at 9/30, so anything after that isn't covered.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"}}
{"seq":17,"trial_id":"v02-heldout-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-gbrain-told-mu-v02-heldout/ms-07-strategic-owners/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T02:29:09.893Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"7c1ebe49444b6c8699b849114f7a18bb10568530b9e504edc5b249536a03d653","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"I've replied to Ruth in the #strategic-pod thread, using only Moss's Strategic digests, which are public files. Two of the four owners are firm. Orlavine is inferred, and Quillfeather isn't confirmed.\n\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato. It moved from Nadia Fennimore to Gideon on 2026-05-04. Moss's 5/3 Sunday prep says it \"changes hands tomorrow, 2026-05-04\", and the 5/4 digest confirms the CRM reassignment that day.\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon Sato. The 5/4 digest says he \"assumed management\" of it that day, though earlier digests already call it \"Gideon's fleet account\".\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** Gideon Sato, but this is inferred. The 9/30 digest only says \"Gideon's medical account\", and Orlavine is the only medical account in it. The March 2025 digest called it Nadia's, and no digest records when it moved.\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** Not confirmed. The digests never name an owner. The only pointer is Nadia hosting the 10/2 gate-clerk training and relaying a Quillfeather request in #strategic-random. I told Ruth to check the CRM with Nadia or Gideon before it goes on the slide.\n\nI also told her the digests stop at 9/30, so anything after that isn't covered."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
